replyText:
{
  "riskLevel": "low",
  "scope": {
    "airportId": "GAO",
    "scenarioPeriod": "Simulation Day 31, 16:00"
  },
  "rationale": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The only usable current report is the simulated correction; it states that current stand support is sufficient, the earlier resource shortage is resolved, and no other current adverse signal is reported.",
        "zh": "唯一可用的当前报告是模拟更正报告；其中说明当前机位保障充足，先前资源短缺已解决，且未报告其他当前不利信号。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The earlier capacity alert is explicitly superseded and marked unusable, retained for audit only.",
        "zh": "先前的运力告警已被明确取代并标记为不可用，仅保留审计。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Neither report confirms an official flight status; individual flight effects remain unknown.",
        "zh": "两份报告均未确认官方航班状态；具体航班影响仍未知。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY",
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The February 2025 monthly operations row shows completion below its prior available-month mean; this is historical context for focused review, not a current risk signal or causation finding.",
        "zh": "2025年2月月度运行记录显示完成率低于其此前可用月份均值；这是供重点复核的历史背景，不是当前风险信号或因果结论。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02"
      ],
      "metricIds": [
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:completion",
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:historical",
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:delta"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Airport scale records classify the simulated airport as small with low airline business importance for 2025.",
        "zh": "机场规模记录将模拟机场归类为小型机场，且2025年航空公司业务重要程度为低。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "SCALE-GAO-2025"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The two current reports are from the same synthetic airport-team group, so independent current confirmation is not established.",
        "zh": "两份当前报告来自同一模拟机场团队组，因此尚未建立独立的当前确认。"
      },
      "kind": "unknown",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY",
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Communication rules require a clearly marked draft for passenger messaging when risk exists but no official flight status is confirmed; it must not be sent as an official notice.",
        "zh": "沟通规则要求，在存在风险但尚无官方航班状态时，旅客信息须为明确标注的草案，不得作为正式通知发送。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "RULE005",
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Citation and simulation-label rules require source IDs and visible simulation marking for any figures or simulated event; this assessment uses only supplied simulated evidence.",
        "zh": "引用与模拟标识规则要求，任何数字或模拟事件均须列出来源编号并显著标注模拟；本评估仅使用提供的模拟证据。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "RULE009",
        "RULE010",
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Privacy rule applies; no passenger or employee personal data is used in this assessment.",
        "zh": "隐私规则适用；本评估未使用旅客或员工个人信息。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "RULE011"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Assumption: the correction remains the latest applicable simulated report for the scenario window and no later contrary report exists.",
        "zh": "假设：在情景窗口内，该更正报告仍为最新适用的模拟报告，且不存在更晚的相反报告。"
      },
      "kind": "assumption",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    }
  ],
  "possibleImpacts": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The usable correction indicates no current capacity shortfall; flight-specific operational disruption cannot be assessed from the supplied reports.",
        "zh": "可用的更正报告表明当前没有运力短缺；仅凭提供的报告无法评估具体航班的运行影响。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Specific affected flights, stands, and official flight status are unknown.",
        "zh": "具体受影响的航班、机位和官方航班状态均未知。"
      },
      "kind": "unknown",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY",
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The February 2025 monthly completion anomaly may warrant focused historical review but does not establish current causation.",
        "zh": "2025年2月月度完成率异常可能需要重点历史复核，但不构成当前因果结论。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02"
      ],
      "metricIds": [
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:completion",
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:historical",
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:delta"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Low airline business importance suggests limited commercial priority, but it does not change safety or verification requirements.",
        "zh": "航空公司业务重要程度低意味着商业优先级有限，但不改变安全或核查要求。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "SCALE-GAO-2025"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Independent current confirmation is not established because the supplied current reports come from the same synthetic group.",
        "zh": "由于提供的当前报告来自同一模拟组，独立的当前确认尚未建立。"
      },
      "kind": "unknown",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY",
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Passenger messaging remains draft-only until human approval because no official flight status exists.",
        "zh": "由于尚无官方航班状态，旅客信息在人工批准前仅为草案。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "RULE005",
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    }
  ],
  "assumptionsToVerify": [
    {
      "en": "The correction applies to the whole scenario period and all relevant stands and terminals.",
      "zh": "该更正报告适用于整个情景时段以及所有相关机位和航站区。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No later contrary simulated report or official status change exists.",
      "zh": "不存在更晚的相反模拟报告或官方状态变化。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No official flight status change has occurred despite the absence of confirmation.",
      "zh": "尽管未获确认，但官方航班状态没有发生变化。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The February 2025 monthly anomaly reflects operational variation rather than missing data or peer-category changes.",
      "zh": "2025年2月月度异常反映的是运行波动，而不是数据缺失或同类机场变化。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The same-team reports are not independent current confirmation.",
      "zh": "同一团队的报告不构成独立的当前确认。"
    }
  ],
  "informationGaps": [
    {
      "en": "Specific affected flights, stands, and time window are not supplied.",
      "zh": "未提供具体受影响的航班、机位和时段。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Official flight status and any airline decisions are not confirmed.",
      "zh": "官方航班状态及任何航空公司决定均未确认。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Independent current confirmation beyond the same synthetic group is not available.",
      "zh": "尚无同一模拟组之外的独立当前确认。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Exact stand and resource counts are not supplied.",
      "zh": "未提供确切的机位和资源数量。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The correction's coverage across terminals, stands, or resource types is not described.",
      "zh": "未说明该更正报告对航站区、机位或资源类型的覆盖范围。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Any current weather or other operational restriction is not supplied.",
      "zh": "未提供当前天气或其他运行限制信息。"
    }
  ],
  "firstAction": {
    "id": "first",
    "kind": "verify",
    "text": {
      "en": "Verify that the correction is the latest applicable simulated report for the scenario window and that no stand or resource restriction remains; do not change or promise flight status.",
      "zh": "核查该更正报告是否为情景窗口内最新适用的模拟报告，以及是否仍存在机位或资源限制；不得更改或承诺航班状态。"
    },
    "evidenceIds": [
      "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
    ],
    "ruleIds": [
      "RULE009",
      "RULE010"
    ]
  },
  "subsequentActions": [
    {
      "id": "follow-1",
      "kind": "prepare_information",
      "text": {
        "en": "Prepare an operations information note for human review that states the correction, marks it simulation and draft, and separates the historical February 2025 anomaly from current risk.",
        "zh": "为人工复核准备运行信息说明，写明更正内容，标注模拟和草案，并将2025年2月历史异常与当前风险区分开。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION",
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02"
      ],
      "ruleIds": [
        "RULE009",
        "RULE010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-2",
      "kind": "prepare_draft",
      "text": {
        "en": "Prepare a passenger draft for human approval with official-update guidance; do not state or imply delay or cancellation.",
        "zh": "为人工批准准备旅客草案，并包含官方更新指引；不得陈述或暗示延误或取消。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION",
        "RULE005",
        "RULE010"
      ],
      "ruleIds": [
        "RULE005",
        "RULE010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-3",
      "kind": "monitor",
      "text": {
        "en": "Monitor for any new independent current report of stand or resource shortfall, or any official flight status change; reassess if one appears.",
        "zh": "监测是否出现新的独立当前报告，显示机位或资源短缺，或官方航班状态变化；如出现则重新评估。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "ruleIds": [
        "RULE009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-4",
      "kind": "prepare_information",
      "text": {
        "en": "Compile scope questions for airport coordination: which stands and time window are covered, whether any restriction remains, and whether any official flight status changed.",
        "zh": "整理向机场协调提出的范围问题：覆盖哪些机位和时段、是否仍有运行限制、官方航班状态是否发生变化。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ],
      "ruleIds": [
        "RULE009"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "escalationConditions": [
    {
      "en": "A new independent current report indicates stand support is insufficient or an impact is expanding.",
      "zh": "新的独立当前报告表明机位保障不足或影响范围正在扩大。"
    },
    {
      "en": "An official flight status change, or a confirmed delay or cancellation, is reported.",
      "zh": "报告出现官方航班状态变化，或确认的延误、取消。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The correction is contradicted by a later verified report.",
      "zh": "该更正报告被更晚的经核实报告否定。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Source reliability becomes unknown or a safety issue arises, requiring action conclusions to stop.",
      "zh": "来源可靠性变为未知或出现安全问题，需要停止行动结论。"
    }
  ],
  "humanDecisions": [
    {
      "en": "Operations lead to approve any external passenger or airport coordination message before release.",
      "zh": "运营负责人在发布前批准任何对外旅客或机场协调信息。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Operations lead to decide whether focused historical review of the February 2025 anomaly is needed.",
      "zh": "运营负责人决定是否需要对2025年2月异常进行重点历史复核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Whether to seek independent current confirmation beyond the same synthetic airport-team reports.",
      "zh": "是否在同一模拟机场团队报告之外寻求独立的当前确认。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Any flight-specific operational decision remains with responsible professionals and is outside this simulation.",
      "zh": "任何具体航班运行决定仍由相应专业人员负责，不在本模拟范围内。"
    }
  ],
  "drafts": {
    "operations": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Operations check: the only usable simulated correction states that current stand support is sufficient and the earlier resource shortage is resolved, with no other current adverse signal. No official flight status is confirmed. Verify the correction's applicability and whether any stand, terminal, or resource restriction remains. Treat the February 2025 monthly completion anomaly as historical context for focused review, not as current causation. Do not issue flight-status, dispatch, or resource decisions from this draft.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。运行核查：唯一可用的模拟更正报告说明当前机位保障充足，先前资源短缺已解决，且无其他当前不利信号。官方航班状态未确认。请核查该更正报告的适用性，以及是否仍存在机位、航站区或资源限制。将2025年2月月度完成率异常视为供重点复核的历史背景，而不是当前因果结论。不得依据本草稿作出航班状态、放行或资源决定。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION",
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02"
      ]
    },
    "airportCoordination": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Airport coordination request for human review: please confirm, within the scenario window, (1) that stand support is sufficient for all relevant stands, (2) whether any stand, terminal, or resource restriction remains and its scope, (3) whether any official flight status has changed, and (4) the correction's update time and coverage. This is a draft request, not a sent message.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。供人工复核的机场协调请求：请在情景窗口内确认：(1) 所有相关机位的保障是否充足；(2) 是否仍存在机位、航站区或资源限制及其范围；(3) 官方航班状态是否发生变化；(4) 更正报告的更新时间与覆盖范围。本草稿为请求草案，尚未发送。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ]
    },
    "passenger": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. In this simulation, the latest airport coordination report says stand support is sufficient and the earlier resource shortage is resolved. No official flight status is confirmed. Please check official airline or airport channels for your flight; this draft is not an official notice and does not confirm any delay or cancellation.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。在本模拟中，最新机场协调报告说明机位保障充足，先前资源短缺已解决。官方航班状态未确认。请通过航空公司或机场官方渠道查询您的航班；本草稿不是正式通知，也不确认任何延误或取消。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION"
      ]
    }
  },
  "evidenceReferences": [
    "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CORRECTION",
    "REPORT:PUBLIC-13-en-CAPACITY",
    "OPS-GAO-2025-02",
    "SCALE-GAO-2025",
    "RULE005",
    "RULE009",
    "RULE010",
    "RULE011"
  ],
  "ruleIds": [
    "RULE009",
    "RULE010",
    "RULE011",
    "RULE005"
  ],
  "decisionConstraints": {
    "professionalDecisionRequired": false,
    "actionConclusionsStopped": false,
    "triggeredRuleIds": [],
    "decisionScope": "Add information that on-site resources are sufficient.",
    "reviewerRoles": [
      {
        "en": "Operations lead",
        "zh": "运营负责人"
      }
    ]
  },
  "outputStatus": "needs_review"
}
